    "body": "\"construct a ReadableStream object\" is scheduled to be changed to use the [CreateReadableStream](https://streams.spec.whatwg.org/#create-readable-stream) abstract operation rather than the ReadableStream constructor. However, this just moves the problem around, as CreateReadableStream() creates a ReadableStream object, and the created object needs to be in a specified realm.",
