    "body": "@ricea e.g., step 9 of https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#http-network-fetch cannot be observable (except maybe theoretically for synchronous fetches, but that's more a bug with how we define synchronous fetching) as fetching happens in parallel so at whatever point you get back to the main thread you'll have to allocate a new object.",
